// "Shroom Wars" — Mushroom Wars 2. Villages grow mushrooms (level 1-4 by upgrade, level 5 only placed on maps: more
// room, faster growth, better defence), towers shoot passing enemies (level 1-4), forges make every mushroom hit harder
// and every building hold better (up to four forges count). Upgrades are paid with the mushrooms inside (towers 20 a
// level); turning a building into another kind costs 30 and starts it at level 1; a captured village or tower drops a
// level. Send a share of a building along the lanes; enemy groups that meet on the way fight. An attack kills
// defenders by attack / defence. Morale (0-5 suns) rises with captures, upgrades and good defence, falls when you lose
// buildings and decays over time; every sun adds attack, defence and speed. Energy (up to 500) regenerates and grows
// with mushrooms lost in attacks; it pays the four skills of the hero chosen for the match (map loadout).
// Numbers per level are approximate (Mushroom Wars 2 does not publish its tables).
